# Generated context-builder markdown. Do not commit these.
# - /output.md is the CLI default. /context.md is this repo's config base name.
# - docs/*.md covers the configured output folder at depth 1 only
#   (docs/context_YYYYMMDDHHMMSS.md). Hand-written files under docs/research/,
#   docs/agent-harness/, and other subdirectories stay tracked.
# - The unanchored pattern is the UTC-second suffix the tool appends:
#   <stem>_YYYYMMDDHHMMSS.md, in any directory.
# - docs/research/context-files/ is the old dump directory.
/output.md
/context.md
docs/*.md
*_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].md
docs/research/context-files/

.context-builder
check_coverage.ps1
tarpaulin-report.html
cobertura.xml
test.md

bench/